      "name": "Landing: Offer",
      "settings": {
        "banner_text": "28 missions.\nClear instructions.\nMore time together.",
        "heading": "Say “I’m proud of you” without saying it.",
        "body": "<p>Advice is rarely what a young father wants to hear, even when it comes with love. The <em><strong>I Am Best Dad In The World</strong></em> kit gives him something more useful: <strong>28 ready-made missions</strong>, each with clear instructions for what he needs, how it works and what to do, step by step.</p><p>It is not a parenting book, and it never tells him what he is doing wrong. <strong>It’s a practical playbook</strong> for time with his children.</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">He opens the book, chooses a mission and they begin.</span> You chose the gift. He gets to be the hero.</p>",
        "closing": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Children forget most of their toys. They remember what their dad did with them.</span></p>",
        "banner_bg_color": "#ee614c",
        "banner_text_color": "#fef1d5",
        "banner_border_color": "#fef1d5",
        "banner_shadow_color": "#000000",
        "background_color": "#2b2d45",
        "text_color": "#ffffff",
        "marker_color": "#ee614c",
        "marker_opacity": 100,
        "divider_top_color": "",
        "divider_bottom_color": "#f2eee7",
        "divider_style": "waves-1-patterned_1200x20",
        "divider_animate": true
      }
    },
    "landing_excerpts_tgTUtE": {
      "type": "landing-excerpts",
      "blocks": {
        "excerpt_drVwBD": {
          "type": "excerpt",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Play with a Toy Boat",
            "text": "<p>Spend a good 15 minutes folding it. Dramatically proclaim: “Behold, my mighty vessel!” Place it in the water. Say: “Look, it floats!” Cue the excitement. … Great, now what? The boat just... sits there. You’re bored. The kid’s bored. Everyone is questioning their life choices. Welcome to the most underwhelming adventure of your kid’s life.</p>"
          }
        },
        "excerpt_Xjk7nV": {
          "type": "excerpt",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Reading",
            "text": "<p>Eventually, your kid will develop favorites. And by favorites, I mean the same book. Every. Single. Night. Welcome to the world of Reading the Same Exact Book for the 157th Time in a Row, where you could narrate it in your sleep. Actually, you probably are. Still—super important bonding moment!!!</p>"
          }
        },
        "excerpt_3JgAHr": {
          "type": "excerpt",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Pirate Treasure Hunt",
            "text": "<p>The treasure: Three soggy cookies? Sure, why not. The treasure isn’t the point. It’s the fact that it was left by freaking pirates!</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "excerpt_drVwBD",
        "excerpt_Xjk7nV",
        "excerpt_3JgAHr"
      ],
